+ 1).toString(), sender: \"bibi\", text: reply }]);\n41:       setIsTyping(false);\n42:       setShowOptions(true); // Allow more clicks\n43:     }, 1200);\n44:   };\n45: \n46:   return (\n47:     <div className=\"card max-w-2xl mx-auto overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-[500px] shadow-pop\">\n48:       <div className=\"bg-peach-200 p-4 border-b-2 border-navy/10 flex items-center gap-3\">\n49:         <div className=\"w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm overflow-hidden border-2 border-navy/10\">\n50:            <BibiMascot mood=\"happy\" className=\"w-10 h-10 translate-y-1\" />\n51:         </div>\n52:         <div>\n53:           <h3 className=\"text-xl font-display font-bold text-navy m-0\">Bibi AI</h3>\n54:           <p className=\"text-sm font-bold text-orange-600 m-0\">Teman Belajar Coding</p>\n55:         </div>\n56:       </div>\n57:       \n58:       <div className=\"flex-1 p-4 overflow-y-auto flex flex-col gap-4 bg-white\">\n59:         {messages.map((msg) => (\n60:           <div key={msg.id} className={`flex ${msg.sender === \"child\" ? \"justify-end\" : \"justify-start\"}`}>\n61:             <div className={`max-w-[80%] p-3 rounded-2xl ${msg.sender === \"child\" ? \"bg-sky text-white rounded-br-sm\" : \"bg-peach-200 text-ink rounded-bl-sm\"}`}>\n62:               {msg.text}\n63:             </div>\n64:           </div>\n65:         ))}\n66:         {isTyping && (\n67:           <div className=\"flex justify-start\">\n68:             <div className=\"bg-peach-200 text-ink p-3 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm flex gap-1 items-center h-11\">\n69:               <span className=\"animate-bounce-soft block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-navy/40 rounded-full\" style={{ animationDelay: '0s' }}></span>\n70:               <span className=\"animate-bounce-soft block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-navy/40 rounded-full\" style={{ animationDelay: '0.15s' }}></span>\n71:               <span className=\"animate-bounce-soft block w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-navy/40 rounded-full\" style={{ animationDelay: '0.3s' }}></span>\n72:             </div>\n73:           </div>\n74:         )}\n75:       </div>\n76: \n77:       <div className=\"p-4 bg-white border-t-2 border-navy/10\">\n78:         <p className=\"text-xs font-bold text-navy-300 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider\">Coba tanya Bibi (Tingkat Bantuan):</p>\n79:         <div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n80:           {showOptions && (\n81:             <>\n82:               <button \n83:                 onClick={() => handleOptionClick(\"Masih bingung nih...\", \"Pikirkan lagi, apakah kamu perlu mengulang kata 'siram' 5 kali atau bisa pakai blok 'Ulangi'? 😉\")}\n84:                 className=\"chip bg-peach text-orange-700 border border-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-600 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n85:               >\n86:                 1. Pertanyaan Pemandu\n87:               </button>\n88:               <button \n89:                 onClick={() => handleOptionClick(\"Kasih contoh lain dong\", \"Sama seperti naik tangga. Langkahmu berulang-ulang sampai di puncak, kan? 🪜\")}\n90:                 className=\"chip bg-peach text-sky-700 border border-sky-700 hover:bg-sky-700 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n91:               >\n92:                 2. Analogi\n93:               </button>\n94:               <button \n95:                 onClick={() => handleOptionClick(\"Blok apa yang harus kupakai?\", \"Coba cari blok berwarna hijau dengan tulisan 'Ulangi'. Masukkan blok aksi ke dalamnya! 🧩\")}\n96:                 className=\"chip bg-peach text-leaf-700 border border-leaf-700 hover:bg-leaf-700 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\"\n97:               >\n98:                 3. Petunjuk Spesifik\n99:               </button>\n100:             </>\n101:           )}\n102:           {!showOptions && !isTyping && <div className=\"h-8\"></div>}\n103:           {!showOptions && isTyping && <div className=\"h-8\"></div>}\n104:         </div>\n105:       </div>\n106:     </div>\n107:   );\n108: }\n109: \n110: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":576,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:07:18Z","input_tokens":2746,"cache_read_tokens":107628,"output_tokens":2505,"thinking":"Initial implementation will incorporate text-to-speech functionality directly into relevant components. A reusable helper or utility will be designed within the designated speech library file to improve code maintainability and testability. The helper will be based on the web speech API.\n\n\nFunctionality for text-to-speech needs to be implemented. Checking for browser support is essential before attempting speech synthesis. Text must be cleaned to remove markdown, URLs, and emojis for better speech output.\n\nA function to stop any ongoing speech will be created to ensure smooth transitions. Parameters for a cheerful, friendly mascot voice, like pitch and rate, will be set, and Indonesian language support will be checked for.\n\n\nChecking the availability of voices immediately after the page loads is unreliable; observed that voice data might not be immediately available. Implementing a mechanism to cache voices and update this cache upon voice changes ensures that voice data is available reliably across browsers, including Chrome and Safari. Integrating this text-to-speech functionality into the main component requires managing the active speech index for visual feedback and auto-read functionality for continuous playback.\n\n\nImplementing a text-to-speech button within the UI for individual messages requires managing its state. The button's label and function dynamically update based on whether speech is active. Auto-read functionality is also implemented by adding a toggle button in the header.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"// Web Speech API text-to-speech helper for Bibi AI (FR-AI-06).\n// Allows children with emerging literacy to hear Bibi's guidance out loud.\n\nexport function isSpeechSupported(): boolean {\n  return typeof window !== \"undefined\" && \"speechSynthesis\" in window;\n}\n\nexport function cleanTextForSpeech(text: string): string {\n  return text\n    // Remove markdown formatting\n    .replace(/[*_#`~>]/g, \"\")\n    // Remove URLs\n    .replace(/https?:\\/\\/\\S+/g, \"\")\n    // Remove emojis so the speech engine doesn't read out emoji descriptions\n    .replace(/[\\u{1F300}-\\u{1F9FF}\\u{1FA00}-\\u{1FAFF}\\u{2600}-\\u{26FF}\\u{2700}-\\u{27BF}]/gu, \"\")\n    // Remove leftover symbols and collapse whitespace\n    .replace(/\\s+/g, \" \")\n    .trim();\n}\n\nlet activeUtterance: SpeechSynthesisUtterance | null = null;\n\nexport function stopSpeaking() {\n  if (typeof window !== \"undefined\" && \"speechSynthesis\" in window) {\n    try {\n      window.speechSynthesis.cancel();\n    } catch {\n      // Ignore cancel errors\n    }\n  }\n  activeUtterance = null;\n}\n\nexport function speakBibiText(\n  text: string,\n  callbacks?: {\n    onStart?: () => void;\n    onEnd?: () => void;\n    onError?: (err: unknown) => void;\n  }\n) {\n  if (!isSpeechSupported()) {\n    callbacks?.onEnd?.();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  stopSpeaking();\n\n  const cleaned = cleanTextForSpeech(text);\n  if (!cleaned) {\n    callbacks?.onEnd?.();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(cleaned);\n  activeUtterance = utterance;\n\n  // Mascot voice personality: friendly, cheerful, slightly higher pitch, gentle pacing for kids\n  utterance.pitch = 1.15;\n  utterance.rate = 0.95;\n\n  const voices = window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();\n  const idVoice = voices.find(\n    (v) =>\n      v.lang.toLowerCase().startsWith(\"id\") ||\n      v.lang.toLowerCase().includes(\"id-id\") ||\n      v.name.toLowerCase().includes(\"indonesia\")\n  );\n\n  if (idVoice) {\n    utterance.voice = idVoice;\n    utterance.lang = idVoice.lang;\n  } else {\n    utterance.lang = \"id-ID\";\n  }\n\n  utterance.onstart = () => {\n    callbacks?.onStart?.();\n  };\n\n  utterance.onend = () => {\n    if (activeUtterance === utterance) {\n      activeUtterance = null;\n    }\n    callbacks?.onEnd?.();\n  };\n\n  utterance.onerror = (e) => {\n    if (activeUtterance === utterance) {\n      activeUtterance = null;\n    }\n    callbacks?.onError?.(e);\n  };\n\n  try {\n    window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);\n  } catch (err) {\n    callbacks?.onError?.(err);\n  }\n}\n","Description":"Create Web Speech API text-to-speech helper for Bibi AI","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"e:/codekids/src/lib/speech.ts","toolAction":"Creating speech.ts","toolSummary":"Speech helper creation"}}]}
